WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.917
The peg marks the contour. The land falls to the right.

00:00:04.917 --> 00:00:12.042
The swale is a level ditch across the slope. Its dug soil forms the bank on the downhill side.

00:00:12.042 --> 00:00:18.083
Runoff enters the hollow. Water can collect here and soak into the soil.

00:00:18.083 --> 00:00:27.083
The growing bed is separate. Its planting surface is raised. You can reach the middle from the paths on either side.

00:00:27.083 --> 00:00:33.625
Find the hollow that holds water. Now find the higher surface where the crops grow.
